melody:
We three kings of O-ri-ent are;
B4(2) A4 G4(2) E4 F#4 G4 F#4 E4(2) r
bear-ing gifts we trav-erse a-far,
B4(2) A4 G4(2) E4 F#4 G4 F#4 E4(2) r
field and foun-tain, moor and moun-tain,
G4(2) G4 A4(2) A4 B4(2) B4 D5 ~C5 B4
fol-low-ing yon-der star.
A4 B4 A4 G4(2) F#4 E4(2) r

O star of won-der, star of night,
F#4(2) ~A4 G4(2) G4 G4(2) D4 G4(2) E4 G4(2) r
star with roy-al beau-ty bright,
G4(2) G4 G4(2) D4 G4(2) E4 G4(2) r
west-ward lead-ing, still pro-ceed-ing,
G4(2) G4 A4(2) B4 C5(2) B4 A4(2) B4
guide us to thy per-fect light.
G4(2) G4 G4(2) D4 G4(2) E4 G4(3)
